    "Connect OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, Ollama, or enable Apple Intelligence to batch-manage your SSH servers with live metrics and approval-gated commands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, Ollama, or enable Apple Intelligence to batch-manage your SSH servers with live metrics and approval-gated commands."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI、Anthropic Claude、Gemini、DeepSeek、Ollama を接続するか Apple Intelligence を有効にすると、承認付きコマンドで複数の SSH サーバーを一括管理できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, Ollama를 연결하거나 Apple Intelligence를 활성화하여 승인 기반 명령으로 여러 SSH 서버를 일괄 관리하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接入 OpenAI、Anthropic Claude、Gemini、DeepSeek、Ollama 或开启 Apple 智能，即可批量管理已添加的 SSH 服务器，支持实时指标巡检与人工确认执行。"
          }
        },
